## Categories

trait-category-physical = Physical
trait-category-medical = Medical
trait-category-mental = Mental
trait-category-meta = Meta

## Temperature

trait-heat-resistant-name = Heat Resistant
trait-heat-resistant-desc = Your body copes better than most with high temperatures.

trait-heat-weakness-name = Heat Intolerant
trait-heat-weakness-desc = High temperatures take a heavier toll on you than they should.

trait-cold-resistant-name = Cold Resistant
trait-cold-resistant-desc = Your body copes better than most with the cold.

trait-cold-weakness-name = Cold Intolerant
trait-cold-weakness-desc = The cold bites at you far more quickly than it does at others.

## Vision

trait-night-vision-name = Night Vision
trait-night-vision-desc = Your eyes adjust to darkness, letting you see where others would be blind.

## Pain

trait-high-pain-tolerance-name = High Pain Tolerance
trait-high-pain-tolerance-desc = You endure injuries that would leave most people incapacitated.

trait-low-pain-tolerance-name = Low Pain Tolerance
trait-low-pain-tolerance-desc = Even minor injuries hurt enough to stop you in your tracks.

## Movement

trait-light-step-name = Light Step
trait-light-step-desc = You move quietly, and your footsteps are far harder to hear.

## Weight

trait-pirate-lightweight-name = Lightweight
trait-pirate-lightweight-desc = You are unusually light, and others can pick you up and carry you with ease.

## Medical

trait-smoke-sensitivity-name = Smoke Sensitivity
trait-smoke-sensitivity-desc = Smoke affects you far more severely than it does most people.

trait-vampiric-blood-deficiency-name = Blood Deficiency
trait-vampiric-blood-deficiency-desc = Your body slowly loses blood on its own, and you will need to replace it to stay healthy.

trait-vampirism-name = Vampirism
trait-vampirism-desc = You can drink blood directly from others to sustain yourself, but holy things burn you.

## Mental

trait-psionic-name = Psionic
trait-psionic-desc = You were born with a latent psionic gift, and can already reach other minds through telepathy.

## Meta

trait-unborgable-name = Unborgable
trait-unborgable-desc = Your nervous system rejects cybernetic integration. You cannot be turned into a cyborg.
